<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Orange raised at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orange raised at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobile phone group Orange Plc was raised to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; at brokerage BZW, market sources said on Wedesday.</p>
<p>The stock was up 2p at 183p by 1120 GMT in trading volume of 2.5 million shares, after yesterday rising 10-1/20.</p>
<p>Analysts at BZW were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Market sources said the brokerage had highlighted the underperformance of Orange shares since their flotation in March.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
